msgid "VPS-Plugin Information"
msgstr "Informasi VPS- Plugin"

msgid ""
"VPS-Plugin can react on delays arising in the startTime or endTime of a programme. VPS is only supported by certain channels!\n"
"\n"
"If you enable VPS, the recording will only start, when the channel flags the programme as running.\n"
"\n"
"If you select \"yes (safe mode)\", the recording is definitely starting at the latest at the startTime you defined. The recording may start earlier or last longer.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Supported channels\n"
"\n"
"Germany:\n"
" ARD and ZDF\n"
"\n"
"Austria:\n"
" ORF\n"
"\n"
"Switzerland:\n"
" SF\n"
"\n"
"Czech Republic:\n"
" CT\n"
"\n"
"If a timer is programmed manually (not via EPG), it is necessary to set a VPS-Time to enable VPS. VPS-Time (also known as PDC) is the first published start time, e.g. given in magazines. If you set a VPS-Time, you have to leave timer name empty."
msgstr ""
"VPS- Plugin dapat bereaksi pada penundaan yang timbul dalam startTime atau "
"EndTime program. VPS hanya didukung oleh saluran tertentu!\n"
"\n"
"Jika Anda mengaktifkan VPS, rekaman hanya akan dimulai, ketika flag saluran "
"program sebagai berjalan.\n"
"\n"
"Jika Anda memilih \"ya (mode aman)\", rekaman tersebut pasti mulai pada yang "
"terbaru pada startTime yang Anda definisikan. Rekaman bisa dimulai lebih "
"awal atau lebih lama lagi.\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"kanal yang didukung\n"
"\n"
"Jerman:\n"
"ARD dan ZDF\n"
"\n"
"Austria:\n"
"ORF\n"
"\n"
"Swiss:\n"
"SF\n"
"\n"
"Republik Ceko:\n"
"CT\n"
"\n"
"Bila suatu timer diprogram secara manual (bukan melalui EPG), diperlukan "
"untuk mengatur VPS-Time untuk mengaktifkan VPS. VPS- Time (juga dikenal "
"sebagai PDC) adalah waktu awal pertama diterbitkan, misalnya diberikan dalam "
"majalah. Jika Anda mengatur VPS-Time, Anda harus meninggalkan nama timer "
"kosong."

