msgstr "When nonzero, a recording will start the nominated period before the starting time indicated in the EPG."

msgid "When nonzero, a recording will stop the nominated period after the ending time indicated in the EPG."
msgstr "When nonzero, a recording will stop the nominated period after the ending time indicated in the EPG."

